      "writtenOn": "2023-09-12T21:03:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "V0 transmits data in BE, so this function needs to convert it to host endianness before it returns it to the caller. That way neither of the callers have to worry about transmission endianness -- the structure is already in host endianness (and that is why the conversion `betohe32` is removed from both `print_ccd_info` and `is_unverified_ro_allowed` since BE was assumed to be the transmission endianess)",
      "parentUuid": "83122318_cdf7777d",
